---
import { siteConfig } from '../../config/site';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Button from '../../components/ui/Button.astro';
import { ArrowRight, FileText, CheckCircle2, FileSpreadsheet, File, Scan } from 'lucide-react';

const title = "CertifiTrack | Convierte tu carpeta desordenada de COIs en un registro limpio";
const description = "Envíanos los PDFs de tus subcontratistas. Organizaremos los documentos, extraeremos la información clave del certificado y te devolveremos un registro limpio en 24-48 horas.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  {/* Hero Section */}
  <section class="relative spacing-section overflow-hidden border-b border-border">
    {/* Subtle gradient background */}
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,_var(--color-muted)_0%,_transparent_50%)] -z-10"></div>
    
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 spacing-content items-center">
        
        {/* Left: Copy */}
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 max-w-xl">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-border bg-surface/50 backdrop-blur-sm px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-muted-foreground mb-6 shadow-sm">
            <span class="flex h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
            Servicio Todo-Incluido
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-display text-foreground spacing-heading text-balance">
            Convierte tu carpeta desordenada en un registro limpio.
          </h1>
          <p class="text-body-large spacing-paragraph">
            Envíanos los PDFs de tus subcontratistas. Organizaremos los documentos, extraeremos la información clave y te devolveremos una hoja de cálculo limpia indicando exactamente quién carece de cobertura.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 items-start sm:items-center mt-8">
            <Button 
              href="/es/upload"
              size="lg"
              class="w-full sm:w-auto shadow-elevated transition-transform hover:scale-105"
            >
              Comienza a Extraer Gratis
            </Button>
            <Button 
              href={siteConfig.socials.github}
              variant="outline"
              size="lg"
              class="w-full sm:w-auto"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              Ver en GitHub
            </Button>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 mt-6 text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><CheckCircle2 class="w-3.5 h-3.5 opacity-40"/> Código abierto</span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><CheckCircle2 class="w-3.5 h-3.5 opacity-40"/> Trae tu propia clave API</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Right: Transformation Visual */}
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative w-full mt-12 lg:mt-0">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:ml-auto">
            
            {/* BEFORE: Messy Files */}
            <div class="flex flex-col bg-surface rounded-xl border border-border shadow-subtle overflow-hidden">
              <div class="px-4 py-3 bg-muted border-b border-border flex items-center justify-between">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-foreground">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-muted-foreground"><path d="M4 20h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-7.93a2 2 0 0 1-1.66-.9l-1.2-1.2A2 2 0 0 0 7.55 3H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v13c0 1.1.9 2 2 2Z"/></svg>
                  <span class="text-xs font-medium tracking-wide">subcontractor_cois_2026.zip</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-muted-foreground">46 elementos</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-col text-[11px]">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 border-b border-border/40 hover:bg-muted/30">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <File class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-muted-foreground/60"/> 
                    <span class="text-foreground">ACORD_25_Atlas_Ridge.pdf</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-muted-foreground">1.2 MB</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 border-b border-border/40 hover:bg-muted/30">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <File class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-muted-foreground/60"/> 
                    <span class="text-foreground">Renewal_COI_Cedar_Point.pdf</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-muted-foreground">840 KB</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 border-b border-border/40 hover:bg-muted/30">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <File class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-muted-foreground/60"/> 
                    <span class="text-foreground">Workers_Comp_2026.pdf</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-muted-foreground">2.1 MB</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 hover:bg-muted/30">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <File class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-muted-foreground/60"/> 
                    <span class="text-foreground">Auto_Liability_COI.pdf</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-muted-foreground">950 KB</span>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-muted/20 px-4 py-1.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground italic border-t border-border/40 text-center">
                  + 42 más archivos sin estructura
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            {/* ARROW */}
            <div class="flex justify-center -my-3 z-10 relative">
              <div class="bg-background border border-border rounded-full p-1.5 shadow-sm text-muted-foreground">
                <ArrowRight class="w-4 h-4 rotate-90 lg:rotate-0" />
              </div>
            </div>

            {/* AFTER: Clean Tracker */}
            <div class="flex flex-col bg-surface rounded-xl border border-border shadow-elevated overflow-hidden">
              <div class="px-4 py-3 bg-muted border-b border-border flex items-center gap-2">
                <FileSpreadsheet class="w-4 h-4 text-status-active" />
                <span class="text-xs font-medium text-foreground tracking-wide">Tracker_Maestro_Final.xlsx</span>
              </div>
              <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                <table class="w-full text-left text-[10px] font-sans whitespace-nowrap">
                  <thead class="bg-background text-muted-foreground border-b border-border">
                    <tr>
                      <th class="px-3 py-2 font-medium border-r border-border">Subcontratista</th>
                      <th class="px-3 py-2 font-medium border-r border-border">Exp. RC</th>
                      <th class="px-3 py-2 font-medium border-r border-border">Exp. RT</th>
                      <th class="px-3 py-2 font-medium border-r border-border">Límite RC</th>
                      <th class="px-3 py-2 font-medium">Estado</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody class="divide-y divide-border text-foreground bg-surface">
                    <tr class="hover:bg-muted/50 transition-colors">
                      <td class="px-3 py-2 font-medium border-r border-border">Atlas Ridge Mechanical</td>
                      <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border">10/12/26</td>
                      <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border">05/01/26</td>
                      <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border">$1M / $2M</td>
                      <td class="px-3 py-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-sm bg-status-active-bg px-1.5 py-0.5 font-semibold text-status-active border border-status-active-border">VIGENTE</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr class="hover:bg-muted/50 transition-colors">
                      <td class="px-3 py-2 font-medium border-r border-border">Cedar Point Roofing</td>
                      <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border text-status-expired font-medium">01/14/26</td>
                      <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border">11/30/26</td>
                      <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border">$2M / $4M</td>
                      <td class="px-3 py-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-sm bg-status-expired-bg px-1.5 py-0.5 font-semibold text-status-expired border border-status-expired-border">VENCIDO</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr class="hover:bg-muted/50 transition-colors">
                      <td class="px-3 py-2 font-medium border-r border-border">Northstar Electrical</td>
                      <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border">08/20/26</td>
                      <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border text-status-review font-medium">09/01/26</td>
                      <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border">$1M / $2M</td>
                      <td class="px-3 py-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-sm bg-status-review-bg px-1.5 py-0.5 font-semibold text-status-review border border-status-review-border">POR VENCER</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr class="hover:bg-muted/50 transition-colors">
                      <td class="px-3 py-2 font-medium border-r border-border">Summit Valley Concrete</td>
                      <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border">—</td>
                      <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border">—</td>
                      <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border">—</td>
                      <td class="px-3 py-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-sm bg-status-missing-bg px-1.5 py-0.5 font-semibold text-status-missing border border-status-missing-border">FALTANTE</span></td>
                    </tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* How It Works */}
  <section class="spacing-section bg-background">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-h2 text-foreground spacing-heading">Cómo funciona</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-balance">Ejecútalo localmente o despliégalo tú mismo.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="relative grid md:grid-cols-3 spacing-content text-center">
        <div class="hidden md:block absolute top-6 left-[16%] right-[16%] h-px bg-border -z-10"></div>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center group">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-background border border-border flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground mb-5 shadow-subtle group-hover:border-accent group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">1</div>
          <h3 class="text-h3 text-foreground mb-2">Configura tu clave API</h3>
          <p class="text-body max-w-[280px] text-balance">Trae tu propia clave API de Google Gemini. Tus datos van directamente al proveedor.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center group">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-background border border-border flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground mb-5 shadow-subtle group-hover:border-accent group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">2</div>
          <h3 class="text-h3 text-foreground mb-2">Sube tus archivos</h3>
          <p class="text-body max-w-[280px] text-balance">Sube tu carpeta desordenada de COI como un archivo ZIP. El backend local lo procesa de forma segura.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center group">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-background border border-border flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground mb-5 shadow-subtle group-hover:border-accent group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">3</div>
          <h3 class="text-h3 text-foreground mb-2">Obtén tu Registro</h3>
          <p class="text-body max-w-[280px] text-balance">Recibe tu registro estructurado en Excel resaltando los registros faltantes y vencidos en 24–48 horas.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* What You Receive Section */}
  <section class="spacing-section bg-surface border-y border-border">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 order-2 lg:order-1">
          <div class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl shadow-elevated overflow-hidden">
            <div class="bg-muted/30 px-4 py-3 border-b border-border flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-xs font-medium text-foreground flex items-center gap-2"><FileSpreadsheet class="w-4 h-4 text-muted-foreground"/> Registro_Maestro_Final.xlsx</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground font-semibold">Resultado</span>
            </div>
            <div class="overflow-x-auto p-4">
              <table class="w-full text-left text-[11px] font-sans whitespace-nowrap">
                <thead class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground font-semibold mb-2 border-b border-border">
                  <tr>
                    <th class="pb-2 pr-4">Subcontratista</th>
                    <th class="pb-2 pr-4">Venc. RC</th>
                    <th class="pb-2 pr-4">Límite RC</th>
                    <th class="pb-2">Estado</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody class="divide-y divide-border/50 text-foreground">
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-2.5 pr-4 font-medium">Atlas Ridge Mechanical</td>
                    <td class="py-2.5 pr-4 text-muted-foreground">10/12/26</td>
                    <td class="py-2.5 pr-4 text-muted-foreground">$1M / $2M</td>
                    <td class="py-2.5"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-sm bg-status-active-bg px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-semibold text-status-active border border-status-active-border">VIGENTE</span></td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-2.5 pr-4 font-medium">Cedar Point Roofing</td>
                    <td class="py-2.5 pr-4 text-status-expired font-medium">01/14/26</td>
                    <td class="py-2.5 pr-4 text-muted-foreground">$2M / $4M</td>
                    <td class="py-2.5"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-sm bg-status-expired-bg px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-semibold text-status-expired border border-status-expired-border">VENCIDO</span></td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-2.5 pr-4 font-medium">Northstar Electrical</td>
                    <td class="py-2.5 pr-4 text-muted-foreground">—</td>
                    <td class="py-2.5 pr-4 text-muted-foreground">—</td>
                    <td class="py-2.5"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-sm bg-status-missing-bg px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-semibold text-status-missing border border-status-missing-border">FALTANTE</span></td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5 order-1 lg:order-2">
          <h2 class="text-h2 text-foreground spacing-heading">Lo que recibes</h2>
          <p class="text-body spacing-paragraph">No te arrojamos datos sin procesar. Devolvemos un registro estructurado que tu equipo realmente puede usar para revisar fechas de certificados, límites y documentos faltantes.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-body text-foreground"><CheckCircle2 class="w-5 h-5 text-accent shrink-0"/> Subcontratistas vinculados a PDFs</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-body text-foreground"><CheckCircle2 class="w-5 h-5 text-accent shrink-0"/> Fechas de vencimiento extraídas</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-body text-foreground"><CheckCircle2 class="w-5 h-5 text-accent shrink-0"/> Documentos faltantes marcados</li>
          </ul>
          <Button href="/es/templates/coi-tracking-spreadsheet" variant="outline" class="w-full sm:w-auto">
            Ver Ejemplo de Salida
          </Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Final CTA */}
  <section class="spacing-section bg-background">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-3xl text-center">
      <h2 class="text-h2 text-foreground spacing-heading text-balance">Deja de escribir manualmente datos de COI.</h2>
      <p class="text-body-large spacing-paragraph">Ejecuta CertifiTrack localmente para procesar tus certificados al instante.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4 mt-8">
        <Button 
          href="/es/upload"
          size="lg"
          class="shadow-elevated transition-transform hover:scale-105"
        >
          Prueba la Demo
        </Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
